<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Dec 25 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Dec 25 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED DECEMBER 18</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............785,400 down.....300</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......707,300 up.....2,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......509,200 up.....2,900</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED DECEMBER 25</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....782,198 down...1,528</p>
<p> Financial companies.......601,964 up.....4,734</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,730 down......63</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,492 down......56</p>
</text>
